# tbSTATISpaper
     
This repository contains the code to produce the results for "An Integrated Data-Driven
Model for Clinical Phenotyping of Tuberculosis Disease Severity" by Malatesta et al. 2025. It contains code to run the simulations assessing the performance of TB-STATIS 
and the application to two different TB data sets.

To apply TB-STATIS to your data, please see the R package we developed that
is available at <https://github.com/samalatesta/tbSTATIS.git>.     

For questions, please contact: Samantha Malatesta (<samalate@bu.edu>)